+## Usage reported to `afterModelResponse`
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits ([chatOrchestrator.ts](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts)), and receives the usage of every provider call the turn made — the sum of the rounds that reported one, so a turn that ran tools is no longer billed or audited from its final call alone ([validated by: reports the usage of every provider call in a two-round tool turn, not only the last](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L56)).
